{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The engine ships "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attack"},{"type":"text","text":" as a stub verb, so every game already knows the word"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and answers it with a sentence. This library takes the word over and puts a body"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"behind it. A swing resolves a weapon, rolls once out of a hundred against a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"per-weapon table, and spends the villain’s health; a knockout puts him on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"floor for 2 turns; the last hit prints his death line, runs the host’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDefeat"},{"type":"text","text":" hook, and removes him from play — so the death line is the last thing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"said about him, and has to account for the body. The exchange a player recognizes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from Zork — swing, answer, swing — is written nowhere. It falls out of the turn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pipeline: the player’s blow resolves in the command stages and the villain’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lands with the end-of-turn timers."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the library claims "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".attack"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MeleeCombat(text:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is where that verb’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"voice lives. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"text.stubs.attack"},{"type":"text","text":" is the line a game without combat"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prints, and a game with this library never prints it. The four refusals the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mechanics own — swinging at something no villain rule claimed, swinging"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bare-handed, naming a feather as a weapon, naming a sword you aren’t holding —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", passed at init."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameContent"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle rather than a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GamePlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" because it saves a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ledger: each villain’s health, his stun countdown, whether he is currently in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fight, and the player’s own wounds, keyed by a string the host chooses. Nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"else belongs to it. The villains are the host’s actors, the weapons are the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host’s items carrying the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" trait, and every line"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either side speaks arrives as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which carry no defaults at all — a library"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot guess a villain’s death sentence."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every roll draws from the game’s seeded stream, so a pinned seed replays a fight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"blow for blow. The guards are ordered so quiet turns draw nothing: a villain in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another room, or behind a closed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"when:"},{"type":"text","text":" gate, or already engaged, burns no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"randomness, which is what keeps one villain’s presence from shifting another"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"villain’s draws. Two simplifications are deliberate and want ledgering per game:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the player’s wounds never heal, and a defeated villain stays defeated."}]},{"text":"Wiring it in","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Wiring-it-in"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Mark the weapons, register each villain in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"type":"text","text":", and splice his"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"counter-attack daemon into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoMeleeCombat","","struct Cavern: Game {","    let melee = MeleeCombat()","","    let sword = Item {","        name(\"elvish sword\")","        trait(.weapon, true)","        trait(.weaponStrength, 3)   \/\/ a keen blade: misses less, kills more","    }","    let troll = Actor { name(\"troll\") }","    let axe = Item { name(\"bloody axe\") }","    @Global var passageClear = false","","    var content: GameContents { melee }","","    var rules: Rules {","        melee.villain(","            troll, key: \"troll\", strength: 2,","            prose: MeleeCombat.VillainProse(","                miss: [\"The troll swings; the axe bites air.\"],","                wound: [\"Your blow lands, and the troll grunts.\"],","                knockout: \"The troll drops where he stood, out cold.\",","                \/\/ The body dissolves in the line, because the actor is","                \/\/ removed a moment later and nothing else will say so.","                death: \"The troll dies, and his body dissolves.\"),","            onDefeat: {","                passageClear = true          \/\/ unbar the door","                axe.move(to: player.location)  \/\/ and drop the loot","            })","    }","","    var timers: [TimedEvent] {","        melee.aggression(","            of: troll, key: \"troll\", named: \"melee.troll\",","            strikesFirst: 33,","            prose: MeleeCombat.AggressionProse(","                miss: [\"The axe passes within an inch of your ear.\"],","                wound: [\"The axe catches your shoulder.\"],","                playerDeath: \"The troll's axe removes your head.\"))","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The two calls share a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key:"},{"type":"text","text":", and that is the whole of the connection between"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them. A villain registered with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"villain"},{"type":"text","text":" alone never fights back and stays down"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for good once knocked out; one given an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aggression"},{"type":"text","text":" daemon wakes up on his own."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every item carrying "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is eligible by default. A named"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"weapon must carry the trait and be held. With no weapon named, the keenest held"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"trait-marked item is chosen; ties follow the inventory’s stable item-ID order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weapons:"},{"type":"text","text":" only when a particular villain has a narrower vulnerability:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the supplied items form a restriction, and each must still carry "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".weapon"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"The numbers","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"The-numbers"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" slides the outcome cutpoints, out of 100."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Strength 2 is the baseline — miss ≤ 30, wound ≤ 70, knockout ≤ 85, kill above —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so a plain "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with no keenness declared fights as it did"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the trait existed. Strength 1 or less is a clumsy blade at 40\/76\/90;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"3 or more is a keen one at 22\/64\/82. When the player names no weapon, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keenest one he is holding serves."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The counter-attack rolls a flat table: miss ≤ 50, wound ≤ 85, an outright kill"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"above. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"playerStrength"},{"type":"text","text":" is the wound that kills the player: at the default of 2, the first wound is survived and the second is fatal."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"strikesFirst"},{"type":"text","text":" is the odds out of 100 that a villain starts a fight on a turn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the player hasn’t — 100 fights on sight, 0 only ever answers a blow, and neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of those two values draws from the stream. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"when:"},{"type":"text","text":" is an extra gate checked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the same-room guard, for a villain whose combat is scoped to one room; it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not gate coming round from a knockout, so a man knocked out where his gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is shut still wakes up."}]},{"text":"The worked example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"The-worked-example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Zork1\/"},{"type":"text","text":" wires two villains against this library. The troll is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"straightforward one: he blocks a passage, starts a fight one turn in three, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"his axe is lootable once he falls. The thief is the awkward one, and is why"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"when:"},{"type":"text","text":" exists — he prowls the whole underground picking pockets and fights"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only in his own lair, so his gate is closed on almost every turn he is alive."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The attack verbs promoted to a mechanic: weapons, villain health, and a villain who answers.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/init(text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/verbs","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/actions"],"title":"The bundle","anchor":"The-bundle"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/villain(_:key:strength:weapons:prose:onDefeat:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/aggression(of:key:named:strikesFirst:playerStrength:when:prose:)"],"title":"Registering a villain","anchor":"Registering-a-villain"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength"],"title":"Traits the host declares on its items","anchor":"Traits-the-host-declares-on-its-items"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/init()","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/attackFutile","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/noWeapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/notAWeapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/weaponNotHeld"],"title":"The system’s own voice","anchor":"The-systems-own-voice"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/init(miss:wound:knockout:death:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/miss","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/wound","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/knockout","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/death"],"title":"A villain’s lines","anchor":"A-villains-lines"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/init(miss:wound:playerDeath:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/miss","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/wound","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/playerDeath"],"title":"His counter-attack lines","anchor":"His-counter-attack-lines"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoMeleeCombat"}],"role":"collection","title":"GnustoMeleeCombat","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"GnustoMeleeCombat"},"references":{"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/VillainProse/knockout":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Printed when a blow knocks the villain unconscious.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"knockout"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"title":"knockout","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/knockout","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/villainprose\/knockout"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/Gnusto/TraitKey/weaponStrength":{"role":"symbol","title":"weaponStrength","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/gnusto\/traitkey\/weaponstrength","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How keen a weapon is in melee — the original’s per-weapon distinction."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A higher value misses less and kills more; the outcome table reads it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to slide the cutpoints. Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"2"},{"type":"text","text":", the baseline table, so a plain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".weapon"},{"type":"text","text":" with no keenness declared fights exactly as before."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"weaponStrength"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TraitKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8TraitKeyV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/Text/notAWeapon":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/notAWeapon","kind":"symbol","title":"notAWeapon","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/text\/notaweapon","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Naming a weapon that isn’t one (“attack troll with feather”)."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notAWeapon","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Line","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4LineV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Noun","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/Text/noWeapon":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/noWeapon","kind":"symbol","title":"noWeapon","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/text\/noweapon","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Attacking bare-handed with no registered weapon in hand. Offered the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"target’s name, like the other three, because the source branch this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stands in for ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"V-ATTACK"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gverbs.zil:180"},{"type":"text","text":") names the thing being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"swung at — the engine’s own wording declines it."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"noWeapon","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Line","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4LineV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Noun","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/AggressionProse/miss":{"role":"symbol","title":"miss","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/miss","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/aggressionprose\/miss","abstract":[{"text":"Lines rotated when the villain’s counter-attack misses.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"miss"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}]},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/Text/attackFutile":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/attackFutile","kind":"symbol","title":"attackFutile","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/text\/attackfutile","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Attacking something no villain rule claimed. Handed the target’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indefinite","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" name — “a rubber raft”, not “the rubber raft” —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"because a refusal aimed at a whole category of thing is the joke"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"V-ATTACK"},{"type":"text","text":" makes with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"A ,PRSO"},{"type":"text","text":", and a line naming the category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generalizes where a definite one just repeats the command back."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"attackFutile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Line","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4LineV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<",